hadiths[7]{hadithnumber,text}:
"85","(27) Moozon par masah ka bab 89 - Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se hadees bayan ki, al-A'mash se, Ibrahim se, Hammam ibn al-Harith se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Jarir ko dekha ke unhon ne taharat ke bartan se wuzu kiya aur apne moozon par masah kiya, logon ne kaha: Kya aap apne moozon par masah karte hain? Unhon ne kaha: Beshak maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko aisa karte hue dekha hai, unhon ne kaha: To yeh hadees Abdullah ke ashab ko bahut achhi lagti thi, woh kehte the: Beshak unka Islam to (surah) al-Ma'idah ke nuzul ke baad hua tha."
"86","90 - Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Nu'aym ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Bukayr ya'ni Ibn Amir al-Bajali ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Abu Zur'ah se, unhon ne kaha: Jarir ne peshab kiya aur moozon par masah kiya, to kuch logon ne un par etiraz kiya, unhon ne kaha: Beshak yeh (amal) (surah) al-Ma'idah (ke nuzul) se pehle ka tha, unhon ne kaha: Main to Islam hi us waqt laya jab (surah) al-Ma'idah nazil ho chuki thi, aur maine Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko masah karte hue sirf us ke nazil hone ke baad hi dekha hai."
"87","91 - Abd al-Rahman ibn Bishr ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ya'ni Ibn Sa'id ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Taymi se, Bakr se, al-Hasan se, Ibn al-Mughirah ibn Shu'bah se, unke walid se, Bakr ne kaha: Aur hum ne ise Ibn al-Mughirah se, unke walid se suna hai: Ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne wuzu kiya aur apni peshani aur amame par aur moozon par masah kiya."
"88","92 - Abdullah ibn Muhammad ibn Amr al-Ghazzi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ibn Yusuf ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Walid ibn Muslim ne hum se bayan kiya, Thawr ibn Yazid se, Raja ibn Haywah se, al-Mughirah ke katib se, al-Mughirah ibn Shu'bah Raziallahu anhu se: Ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne mooze ke upar aur neeche masah kiya."
"89","93 - Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sulayman ibn Dawud al-Hashimi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi al-Zinad ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Urwah se, al-Mughirah ibn Shu'bah Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko moozon ki peeth (upari hisse) par masah karte hue dekha."
"90","94 - Ali ibn Khashram ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Isa ne hum se bayan kiya, Shu'bah se, al-Hakam aur Hammad se, Ibrahim se, Abu Abdullah al-Jadali se, Khuzaymah ibn Thabit Raziallahu anhu se, Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se (riwayat hai) ke Aap ne farmaya: Musafir ke liye teen din aur unki raaten, aur muqeem ke liye ek din aur ek raat (hai), moozon par masah ke bare mein."
"91","95 - Ya'qub ibn Ibrahim al-Dawraqi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ibn Ma'in ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Wahhab al-Thaqafi ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Muhajir ibn Makhlad se, Abd al-Rahman ibn Abi Bakrah se, unke walid Raziallahu anhu se: Ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne muqeem ke liye ek din aur ek raat, aur musafir ke liye teen din aur unki raaten muqarrar kiye, moozon par masah ke bare mein."
